# Keep all actual secrets in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
# Link an Upstash Redis resource to the Vercel project for durable persistence.
# Vercel/Upstash integration provides KV_REST_API_URL and KV_REST_API_TOKEN.
# Set ALI_VPN_SETUP_TOKEN to a long random secret before the first deployment.
# Remove ALI_VPN_SETUP_TOKEN after creating the first admin account.
# Optional namespace if one Redis database is shared by multiple apps:
# ALI_VPN_KV_PREFIX=ali-vpn-panel
